      "title": "A Guardian Character is Born!",
      "runtime": "24:00",
      "runtime_seconds": 1440,
      "thumb": "https://media.kitsu.app/episodes/thumbnails/44973/original.jpg",
      "synopsis": "People view Amu Hinamori as a \"cool and spicy\" girl; she is actually timid and easily scared. When she wishes to have the courage to show her \"true\" self, she discovers three colorful eggs -red, blue, and green- in her bed. At school, the eggs draw the attention of Tadase Hotori, the most popular boy in school, who Amu has a crush on.",
