      "thumb": "https://media.kitsu.app/episodes/thumbnails/44976/original.jpg",
      "synopsis": "Amu joins the Guardians as \"The Joker\", much to her dismay, and they inform her about the mysterious X Eggs. Ikuto tries to make amends with Amu. A mysterious new teacher named Yuu Nikaidou joins Amu's class.",
