      "thumb": "https://media.kitsu.app/episodes/thumbnails/44977/original.jpg",
      "synopsis": "Amu and Nadeshiko attend Kukai's soccer team practice. One of Kukai's friends, Yamada, is deeply upset when the coach announces he didn't make it to the team. Nikaidou takes advantage of Yamada's feelings and extracts Yamada's Heart's Egg, turning it into an X Egg.",
